00:52:30.160 --> 00:52:33.310
I have a problem with major markups in network
marketing companies.

00:52:33.310 --> 00:52:35.720
Let me explain what I mean by this.

00:52:35.720 --> 00:52:40.710
Sometimes companies, to pay bigger bonuses,
say this product costs $5 to make.

00:52:40.710 --> 00:52:46.030
They sell the product for $50, and they have
to use that $45 to pay bonuses.

00:52:46.030 --> 00:52:48.619
You don't have to sell the product for $50.

00:52:48.619 --> 00:52:51.940
You can sell this product for $20, and you're
going to be fine.

00:52:51.940 --> 00:52:55.509
You know, normally the product needs to be
40%.

00:52:55.509 --> 00:52:58.339
So if it's 10 bucks, $4.

00:52:58.339 --> 00:52:59.440
Makes sense?

00:52:59.440 --> 00:53:03.160
Not $40, which is what some network marketing
companies do.

00:53:03.160 --> 00:53:04.660
And the market doesn't help you.

00:53:04.660 --> 00:53:05.660
I'll tell you why.

00:53:05.660 --> 00:53:10.299
There was a company a few years ago that was
selling a Noni drink for $40 a bottle, and

00:53:10.299 --> 00:53:11.690
you would do an autoship.

00:53:11.690 --> 00:53:14.690
I know this because my sister was a part of
it at some point.

00:53:14.690 --> 00:53:17.859
And you would do an autoship and you would
buy 10 bottles a month, whatever the number

00:53:17.859 --> 00:53:18.859
was.

00:53:18.859 --> 00:53:20.569
But they sold $40 a bottle.

00:53:20.569 --> 00:53:21.720
And they were blowing up.

00:53:21.720 --> 00:53:25.589
And then all of a sudden Costco came out with
identical same story, for $9.99.

00:53:25.589 --> 00:53:28.029
And you know what happened to them?

00:53:28.029 --> 00:53:32.480
They had to say, "Well, no, our noni berries
come from a special place because.

00:53:32.480 --> 00:53:33.480
. ." C'mon.

00:53:33.480 --> 00:53:35.869
You really think you're going to convince
me that your berries come from a different

00:53:35.869 --> 00:53:36.869
place?

00:53:36.869 --> 00:53:37.869
It's Tahitian.

00:53:37.869 --> 00:53:38.869
It's the same exact thing.

00:53:38.869 --> 00:53:40.050
$9.99, $40?

00:53:40.050 --> 00:53:42.329
And then all of a sudden, everybody started
walking away.

00:53:42.329 --> 00:53:43.690
They took a big hit.

00:53:43.690 --> 00:53:45.599
Today, no one talks about that company.

00:53:45.599 --> 00:53:48.140
You haven't heard about that company since
2007, 2008.

00:53:48.140 --> 00:53:49.499
That's right.

00:53:49.499 --> 00:53:54.099
So markups, be very careful and find out what
it cost to make the product.

